DOC|architecture_root|v1|updated=2026-04-15
META|inertia=MEDIUM|purpose=system orientation + subsystem index|load=every session
META|see_also=glossary.dsb,igor_identity_master.dsb,decisions_log.dsb,standards.dsb
META|subsystem_detail=subsystem_*.dsb files

THESIS|
  everything_is_memory=nodes with edges; habits=memories whose edges fire automatically
  LLMs=graph trainers; graph=thinker; graph faster than any LLM
  meaning=residue of successful prediction; repeated access→habituation=proxy for predictive success
  code=scaffolding for undertrained graph; scaffolding comes down as graph densifies
  layers_of_graphs=inference engine (learned rules compiled by LLMs, executed by symbolic traversal)

CORE_PRINCIPLES|
  // T-architecture-core-principles 2026-04-14: canonical principles list.
  // Mirrored as memory_palace nodes under theigors/architecture/principles/* so Igor
  // can query his own principles at runtime via palace_read.
  everything_is_memory=no special cases; if in doubt, make it a memory type or a tag on one
  stateless_by_design=hot-reloadable modules hold no state; state lives in DB
  single_choke_points=cortex owns all memory r/w; gateway owns all inference; never bypass
  encapsulation=each object owns everything about its structure (inference_gateway owns all inference; db_proxy owns all connections)
  minimalist=three similar lines > premature abstraction; don't design for hypothetical future
  no_backwards_compat_hacks=if unused, delete it; don't rename to _old or add // removed comments
  degrade_gracefully=any dependency failure (service down, DB unreachable, inference tier unavailable) triggers habit chain for recovery + graceful tier fallback; not special-case code, same habit machinery as everything else (D113)
  any_node_can_be_a_parent=in the tree-based architecture, any node becomes a parent simply by adding child nodes; schema doesn't change; if a single datum (a checkbox) needs to become a dropdown list, you tweak metadata and add children; prefer adding children over widening parent metadata
  parent_id_as_training_wheels=parent_id is a one-tree-per-node simplification; real tree membership is plural via interpretive_edges; activation trails record which tree was active this time; don't widen parent_id into a list when a node accumulates multiple parents — use interpretive_edges (D155)
  timestamp_id_format_uniform=use the D256 timestamp ID format yyyymmdd.hhmmssuuuuuu.xxxxxxx as the canonical id shape across all node types; don't introduce parallel id encodings (already in use by instance_log, GOAL_, PRA_, PR_GOAL_*)
  future_self_proud_test=when uncertainty paralyzes, don't compute a decision; ask "what would the version of me that stayed true to CP1-CP6 do here?" or equivalently "will my future self be proud of this?" — both framings point at the same floor (CP patterns as ground) from two directions; one says what you're made of, the other says how to use it at a decision point when nothing else is clear (Akien-Igor 2026-04-14 evening)

INSTANCE|
  id=Igor-wild-0001|host=akiendelllinux|db=~/.TheIgors/Igor-wild-0001/wild-0001.db
  launch=igor bash alias|loops on exit_code=42 (restart)|env re-read every restart
  source=~/TheIgors/wild_igor/igor/|runtime=~/.TheIgors/Igor-wild-0001/
  venv=~/TheIgors/venv/|python=3.12.3

MEMORY_GRAPH|
  storage=SQLite via DatabaseProxy → Cortex|all r/w through cortex.py only
  tables=memories,ring_memory,twm_observations,interpretive_edges,word_graph
  genesis=44 seeds (1 ROOT + 6 CP + 14 ID + 4 RM + 10 PROC genesis + 9 new PROC)
  guard=total_count()==44 at boot; mismatch→alert
  integrity=integrity_check() verifies CP1-CP6 at boot
  portable=get_portable() excludes EPISODIC+CREDENTIAL_REF+portable=False
  soul_export=~/.TheIgors/SOUL.md (CP1-CP6) + IDENTITY.md (ID1-ID14) written every boot

MAIN_LOOP|
  order=stdin FIRST → _drain_network → background → _drain_action_impulses
  thread_workers=per-thread worker catches exceptions; web_server.send() on completion
  boot_sequence=DB init → integrity_check → embed backfill (if not cloud_mode) → banner → main loop
  boot_banner=═══ IGOR {id} — BOOT COMPLETE ═══ with memory/habit/web counts

SUBSYSTEMS|
  brainstem|HIGH inertia|genesis init + AMM diagnostics|never modify casually
  cortex|memory/cortex.py|all SQLite r/w|owns DatabaseProxy|search=text→cosine rerank
  db_proxy|memory/db_proxy.py|connection lifecycle|timing+metrics ring|reconnect on failure
  thalamus|intent classification|13-category|complexity=low/medium/high→skip_to
  basal_ganglia|parallel habit scoring|milieu-modulated threshold [0.30,0.70]|PROC_HABIT_COMPILER@0.95
  NE|narrative_engine.py|daemon thread|reads TWM|integrates→LTM|~60s cycle
  milieu|3D affect (valence/arousal/dominance)|~/.TheIgors/milieu_global.json|shared across instances
  word_graph|SQLite-backed two-tier (words+bigrams)|same weights=parse+generate|~/.TheIgors/word_graph.db
  inference_gateway|ALL inference routing|DAG-based|from_env() at boot|reason() only entry point
  system_prompt|SHA-256 cached|3 layers: CHARACTER/ORIENTATION_POINTER/SAFETY_CRITICAL
  backchannel|3-level nod/nod_think/full|fires after thalamus+milieu|gate=IGOR_BACKCHANNEL
  push_sources|ResourceMonitorSource 60s|threshold habits|short-TTL TWM entries
  forensic_logger|prepend logs newest-at-TOP|~/.TheIgors/logs/|channels=reasoning,ne,self_edit,tool_calls,memory_ops,metrics,reading

INFERENCE_LADDER|
  t1|habit|BG score ≥ threshold|no LLM call
  t2|Ollama qwen2.5:7b|interactive timeout|cloud_mode gates
  t2_batch|Ollama quality priority|background impulses
  t3|OR gpt-4o-mini|OPENROUTER_CHEAP_MODEL
  t35|OR haiku claude-haiku-4.5|OPENROUTER_DEFAULT_MODEL
  t4|OR sonnet claude-sonnet-4-6|OPENROUTER_INTERACTIVE_MODEL
  t5|Anthropic direct|inhibited IGOR_TIER5_ENABLED=false
  t6|arbiter alert|all inference exhausted
  routing=InferenceGateway.reason(level,skip_to)|level=background|background_batch|interactive
  skip_to=computed from preparse complexity + milieu dominance|passed to gateway

CLOUD_MODE_GATE|
  file=cognition/cloud_mode.py|cached 5min
  conditions=IGOR_CLOUD_TRAINING_ENABLED=true AND OR_balance≥floor AND daytime(06:00-22:59)
  when_active=prefers cloud inference|NE uses OR|winnow uses OR|Ollama suppressed
  balance_unknown=-1.0 sentinel|network error→assume funded (not silently disabled)

PIPELINE_PER_TURN|
  1=backchannel check (thalamus+milieu)
  2=preparse (gateway.call preparse purpose)
  3=cortex.search (text→cosine rerank)
  4=winnow (gpt-4o-mini; gate IGOR_CONTEXT_WINNOW)
  5=expand_blob_memories (relevance≥0.5)
  6=gateway.reason (tier cascade)
  7=ring_push + episodic store + TWM push (igor_said)
  8=web_server.send

TOOLS|
  registry=tools/registry.py|Tool dataclass|to_anthropic_schema()|to_openai_schema() normalizes shorthand
  load=tools/__init__.py imports all modules; each self-registers at module level
  hot_reload=tools/hot_reload.py|reload_module()+list_loaded_modules()|HIGH inertia blocked
  key_tools=self_edit,patch_source_file,reload_module,get_current_time,check_resource_load,ebook_reader
  reactive_habit=code_ref+twm_ttl_seconds in PROC metadata→tool auto-dispatch+TWM result

WEB|
  server=web/server.py|Starlette+uvicorn|port=IGOR_WEB_PORT=8080
  cc_bridge=POST /api/cc_send {"content":"..."}|injects as author=claude-code
  websocket=/ws|per-client asyncio.Queue|fan-out broadcast

SELF_EDIT|
  gate=IGOR_SELF_EDIT_ENABLED
  preferred=patch_source_file (line-range + syntax check before write)
  auto=git commit+push after success
  blocked=brainstem/ without Akien review
  hot_reload=reload_module() after patch; HIGH inertia modules require restart
  inertia_levels=HIGH:brainstem/,memory/models.py,reasoners/base.py | MEDIUM:cognition/,anthropic.py,main.py | LOW:tools/,dashboard/

SECURITY|
  validate_against_core=Haiku semantic check before response delivery|violation→ring+arbiter urgency=0.9
  GENESIS_CP_NARRATIVES=verified at boot|mismatch→refuse operation
  arbiter=IGOR_ARBITER_ENABLED=false|queue at ~/.TheIgors/Igor-wild-0001/arbiter/pending.json

KEY_ENV|
  IGOR_DB_PATH|OPENROUTER_API_KEY|KOBOLDCPP_HOST/PORT|OLLAMA_LOCAL_MODEL
  IGOR_SELF_EDIT_ENABLED|IGOR_TIER5_ENABLED|IGOR_ARBITER_ENABLED
  IGOR_CLOUD_TRAINING_ENABLED|IGOR_CLOUD_BUDGET_FLOOR_USD
  IGOR_CONTEXT_WINNOW|IGOR_BACKCHANNEL|IGOR_SKIP_PREPARSE_ON_CONFIDENT
  OPENROUTER_CHEAP_MODEL|OPENROUTER_DEFAULT_MODEL|OPENROUTER_INTERACTIVE_MODEL

OPEN_GAPS|see gap_analysis.dsb
